(2804077, 390887, 51653, '<td valign="top">I needed some seconds to understand this shot, but after that I think it is the most emotional and romantic shot I found in the challenge up to now. I think everyone having childrens will agree.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately there are some technical issue damaging the shot pathos. The f ocus is the first point. It seems there is a too narrow dof. This make the whole shot too soft and make the frog eyes too blur to be pleasant.<br/>A second point regards the differences between the two hands skins. With the light you used they seems too similar to be of immediate impact. I think you could try to change the light set up and/or to soil the father hand to highlight its wrinkle.</td>', 'I needed some seconds to understand this shot, but after that I think it is the most emotional and romantic shot I found in the challenge up to now. I think everyone having childrens will agree. Unfortunately there are some technical issue damaging the shot pathos. The f ocus is the first point. It seems there is a too narrow dof. This make the whole shot too soft and make the frog eyes too blur to be pleasant.A second point regards the differences between the two hands skins. With the light you used they seems too similar to be of immediate impact. I think you could try to change the light set up and/or to soil the father hand to highlight its wrinkle.', '2006-09-06 08:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
