(2806814, 390067, 53316, '<td valign="top">Yay for this wonderful gift from God. :-D<br/> <br/>edit: I have a story to tell you. I viewed this image last night and it remained in my head throughout the evening. When I got into bed I turned to a random Psalm to read before I went to sleep.  I found myself reading "The works of the Lord are great, studied by all who have pleasure in them". It''s 111:2 in the NIV.  And I thought it was so neat to read about taking pleasure in God and his works after viewing your photographic depiction of this "simple pleasure".<br/> <br/>This photo may not be the most visually impressive, but as for meaning, it is so amazingly wonderful. Thank you for sharing this with us.</td>', 'Yay for this wonderful gift from God. :-D edit: I have a story to tell you. I viewed this image last night and it remained in my head throughout the evening. When I got into bed I turned to a random Psalm to read before I went to sleep.  I found myself reading "The works of the Lord are great, studied by all who have pleasure in them". It''s 111:2 in the NIV.  And I thought it was so neat to read about taking pleasure in God and his works after viewing your photographic depiction of this "simple pleasure". This photo may not be the most visually impressive, but as for meaning, it is so amazingly wonderful. Thank you for sharing this with us.', '2006-09-06 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
