(2809617, 390343, 64623, '<td valign="top">it took me looking at this for a minute to figure out what it was.  It may have been the coffee cup.  Milk doesn''t usually get poured into one of these!</td>', 'it took me looking at this for a minute to figure out what it was.  It may have been the coffee cup.  Milk doesn''t usually get poured into one of these!', '2006-09-07 10:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809620, 391426, 64623, '<td valign="top">This may have been difficult, but I would have liked to see the cat on a simpler background so the focus is solely on him instead of sharing it with the photographer''s legs.</td>', 'This may have been difficult, but I would have liked to see the cat on a simpler background so the focus is solely on him instead of sharing it with the photographer''s legs.', '2006-09-07 10:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809623, 390742, 64623, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the whole piece of chocolate in focus.  Yum!</td>', 'I would have liked to see the whole piece of chocolate in focus.  Yum!', '2006-09-07 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809678, 391695, 41554, '<td valign="top">Why o why do kids love puddles of mud? Nice shot, very sharp.</td>', 'Why o why do kids love puddles of mud? Nice shot, very sharp.', '2006-09-07 10:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809689, 389669, 41554, '<td valign="top">The rails are blown, and so is the right arm. Also, there are some compression artifacts especially noticeable on the model''s face. Other than that, this is a good pic, with nice leading lines, and overall good composition.</td>', 'The rails are blown, and so is the right arm. Also, there are some compression artifacts especially noticeable on the model''s face. Other than that, this is a good pic, with nice leading lines, and overall good composition.', '2006-09-07 10:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809693, 390132, 41554, '<td valign="top">I like mine strong, but this is ridiculous!! LOL</td>', 'I like mine strong, but this is ridiculous!! LOL', '2006-09-07 10:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809701, 391097, 41554, '<td valign="top">The crop isn''t the best, IMHO, and there is lots of noise in this pic. However the "cat" really looks like he''s taking great pleasure from his nap...</td>', 'The crop isn''t the best, IMHO, and there is lots of noise in this pic. However the "cat" really looks like he''s taking great pleasure from his nap...', '2006-09-07 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809705, 391573, 41554, '<td valign="top">Pleasure today, whoknowswhatdiseases tomorrow...<br/>The blurred straw in the foreground is very distracting, and frankly, this has "snapshot" written all over. Sorry, not a winner.</td>', 'Pleasure today, whoknowswhatdiseases tomorrow...The blurred straw in the foreground is very distracting, and frankly, this has "snapshot" written all over. Sorry, not a winner.', '2006-09-07 10:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809716, 390501, 41554, '<td valign="top">Great setting, and good idea. Here''s what I think would make it better: nobody in the water, model''s arms in the same angle, and probably, in colour, and shot more from behind. Just my thoughts.</td>', 'Great setting, and good idea. Here''s what I think would make it better: nobody in the water, model''s arms in the same angle, and probably, in colour, and shot more from behind. Just my thoughts.', '2006-09-07 10:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809718, 391657, 41554, '<td valign="top">The concept might work, but not with this light/setting. Sorry.</td>', 'The concept might work, but not with this light/setting. Sorry.', '2006-09-07 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809726, 389703, 41554, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, but not really much to see here.</td>', 'Good DOF, but not really much to see here.', '2006-09-07 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809745, 388531, 41554, '<td valign="top">If this was shot closer, it might have made for a great pic. As it is, there are some strange reflections on the bowl''s bottom, compression artifacts around the bowl and, generally speaking, some stange colour artifacts all over the pic. Also, I really don''t care much for your choice of colour. Sorry.</td>', 'If this was shot closer, it might have made for a great pic. As it is, there are some strange reflections on the bowl''s bottom, compression artifacts around the bowl and, generally speaking, some stange colour artifacts all over the pic. Also, I really don''t care much for your choice of colour. Sorry.', '2006-09-07 10:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809748, 390596, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, good execution. You might be able to play with levels to make the water less "brownish", but otherwise, this is nice.</td>', 'Nice concept, good execution. You might be able to play with levels to make the water less "brownish", but otherwise, this is nice.', '2006-09-07 10:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809750, 388706, 41554, '<td valign="top">Ah the endless beauty of string instruments. And well shot too. Nice.</td>', 'Ah the endless beauty of string instruments. And well shot too. Nice.', '2006-09-07 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809757, 388396, 41554, '<td valign="top">Too centered, the colours are too weak and, actually, there''s nothing to see. Sorry.</td>', 'Too centered, the colours are too weak and, actually, there''s nothing to see. Sorry.', '2006-09-07 10:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809764, 391473, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I like the idea and the setting is good. With a little more effort you might be able to put the boat in the sweet rule of thirds spot, and further enhance a nice pic.</td>', 'Not bad, I like the idea and the setting is good. With a little more effort you might be able to put the boat in the sweet rule of thirds spot, and further enhance a nice pic.', '2006-09-07 10:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809773, 390935, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yours is a timeless image, in that boys and fishing will be around as long as both exist.  The tones are nice.  Good work.</td>', 'Yours is a timeless image, in that boys and fishing will be around as long as both exist.  The tones are nice.  Good work.', '2006-09-07 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809782, 391704, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, that is a great feeling and nice for an adult to watch - simple pleasure.  The depth of field is very nice.  Great shutter speed too. 10.</td>', 'Indeed, that is a great feeling and nice for an adult to watch - simple pleasure.  The depth of field is very nice.  Great shutter speed too. 10.', '2006-09-07 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809785, 391339, 51538, '<td valign="top">You evoke a nice feeling with your photo. 9.</td>', 'You evoke a nice feeling with your photo. 9.', '2006-09-07 10:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809787, 390501, 51538, '<td valign="top">Anticipation is indeed a nice part of life. 8.</td>', 'Anticipation is indeed a nice part of life. 8.', '2006-09-07 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809788, 391413, 51538, '<td valign="top">Surely a male attribute not to cover ones mouth when doing so ;-) 9.</td>', 'Surely a male attribute not to cover ones mouth when doing so ;-) 9.', '2006-09-07 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
