(2809793, 391426, 51538, '<td valign="top">Surely a Bengal cat?  What a lovely creature.  Nice photo, BTW.</td>', 'Surely a Bengal cat?  What a lovely creature.  Nice photo, BTW.', '2006-09-07 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
