(2810447, 389634, 64175, '<td valign="top">How does this have anything to do with Simple Pleasures?  Is washing of the hands a pleasure?</td>', 'How does this have anything to do with Simple Pleasures?  Is washing of the hands a pleasure?', '2006-09-07 13:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810448, 390578, 64175, '<td valign="top">Wow, um, he looks ....pleasured.</td>', 'Wow, um, he looks ....pleasured.', '2006-09-07 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810450, 391579, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with depth of field but how is this a simple pleasure?</td>', 'Nice shot with depth of field but how is this a simple pleasure?', '2006-09-07 13:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810472, 391232, 64175, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, but I don''t see how this is a simple pleasure.</td>', 'The colors are great, but I don''t see how this is a simple pleasure.', '2006-09-07 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810477, 391195, 64175, '<td valign="top">AWESOME shot.  Best insect photo I''ve seen today.</td>', 'AWESOME shot.  Best insect photo I''ve seen today.', '2006-09-07 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810482, 388063, 64175, '<td valign="top">I need to visit more coffee shops.</td>', 'I need to visit more coffee shops.', '2006-09-07 14:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810488, 391445, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-09-07 14:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810498, 391473, 40718, '<td valign="top">as a former rower, I loved the "swing" of the boat and the sound of the bubbles rushing along the bottom as your oar was out of the water.  A great simple pleasure.  If people are voting you low, they just haven''t experienced it. ;)  Your conversion to B&amp;W is fairly good, but our kayaker is a bit harsh on the lighting.  The composition is excellent and the lilypads add interest for sure. 7</td>', 'as a former rower, I loved the "swing" of the boat and the sound of the bubbles rushing along the bottom as your oar was out of the water.  A great simple pleasure.  If people are voting you low, they just haven''t experienced it. ;)  Your conversion to B&W is fairly good, but our kayaker is a bit harsh on the lighting.  The composition is excellent and the lilypads add interest for sure. 7', '2006-09-07 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810503, 390935, 37965, '<td valign="top">Added to my favorites! what a great picture!</td>', 'Added to my favorites! what a great picture!', '2006-09-07 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810520, 390935, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man, finally a shot I can sink my teeth into.  only the second 8+ after, let''s see, 162 votes.  Sepia was a great choice.  The props are excellent and the composition is nice.  Personally I would have tried to squeeze just a bit more sharpness out of it, but I fully realize I''m a total sharpness hound and not everybody else has the same feeling. 8 for now, could bump later.</td>', 'Man, finally a shot I can sink my teeth into.  only the second 8+ after, let''s see, 162 votes.  Sepia was a great choice.  The props are excellent and the composition is nice.  Personally I would have tried to squeeze just a bit more sharpness out of it, but I fully realize I''m a total sharpness hound and not everybody else has the same feeling. 8 for now, could bump later.', '2006-09-07 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
