(2820292, 391810, 27605, '<td valign="top">Here''s a tip you might want to try.  Using Photoshop, open Hue/Sat and select the YELLOW channel.  I find that if I edge the yellow "hue" slider just a bit to the right it makes those yellows oh so much greener and improves shots such as this, at least as far as my taste is concerned.  Inviting trail there, btw.</td>', 'Here''s a tip you might want to try.  Using Photoshop, open Hue/Sat and select the YELLOW channel.  I find that if I edge the yellow "hue" slider just a bit to the right it makes those yellows oh so much greener and improves shots such as this, at least as far as my taste is concerned.  Inviting trail there, btw.', '2006-09-10 14:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
