(2826636, 391731, 18552, '<td valign="top">It really does look like a joyful thing to do - however, I don''t know if you could really think of it as a "simple pleasure" To me, that means something that is readily available to everyone. Sailing is very expensive and one has to learn how to do it - neither of those things are simple.</td>', 'It really does look like a joyful thing to do - however, I don''t know if you could really think of it as a "simple pleasure" To me, that means something that is readily available to everyone. Sailing is very expensive and one has to learn how to do it - neither of those things are simple.', '2006-09-12 05:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826643, 390946, 18552, '<td valign="top">Yum - this picture makes me want a cookie, right now! Great job.</td>', 'Yum - this picture makes me want a cookie, right now! Great job.', '2006-09-12 05:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826661, 391426, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty cat! He/she looks like Garfield - orange and black. My cats like to snuggle like this, too.</td>', 'What a pretty cat! He/she looks like Garfield - orange and black. My cats like to snuggle like this, too.', '2006-09-12 05:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826663, 391599, 18552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life.</td>', 'Beautiful still life.', '2006-09-12 05:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826682, 389216, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is nice, I like the sepia tones that give it that old-fashioned feeling. To me, it would have seemed more complete if the top of the little girl''s head hadn''t been cut off. She is really the focal point of the picture and somehow, something seems missing when you can''t see all of her head. Even though it is in fashion now to cut off the tops of people''s heads in pictures - to me it looks like a mistake.</td>', 'This is nice, I like the sepia tones that give it that old-fashioned feeling. To me, it would have seemed more complete if the top of the little girl''s head hadn''t been cut off. She is really the focal point of the picture and somehow, something seems missing when you can''t see all of her head. Even though it is in fashion now to cut off the tops of people''s heads in pictures - to me it looks like a mistake.', '2006-09-12 05:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826686, 391809, 18552, '<td valign="top">This does look very fun to do - don''t know if I''d classify it as a "simple pleasure" though. To me, simple pleasures are those available to everyone at very little or no cost. It must be pretty expensive to go on a ballon ride like this.</td>', 'This does look very fun to do - don''t know if I''d classify it as a "simple pleasure" though. To me, simple pleasures are those available to everyone at very little or no cost. It must be pretty expensive to go on a ballon ride like this.', '2006-09-12 05:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826694, 391198, 18552, '<td valign="top">It looks fun but I don''t know if it riding motorcycles like this could really be considered a "simple" pleasure. One must buy the bike and all the gear and then something to haul them to a place to ride - that is very expensive which makes it something not many people can enjoy. I guess I think of "simple pleasure" as something that is available to just about everyone at very little or no cost.</td>', 'It looks fun but I don''t know if it riding motorcycles like this could really be considered a "simple" pleasure. One must buy the bike and all the gear and then something to haul them to a place to ride - that is very expensive which makes it something not many people can enjoy. I guess I think of "simple pleasure" as something that is available to just about everyone at very little or no cost.', '2006-09-12 05:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826697, 391668, 18552, '<td valign="top">How lovely and calm looking. I''d like to be sitting on that porch with my knitting!</td>', 'How lovely and calm looking. I''d like to be sitting on that porch with my knitting!', '2006-09-12 05:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826741, 391413, 64773, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture and evocative as the title. I would have liked to see the rest of the lion''s body, but I guess it would have been in shade a bit too much?</td>', 'This is a great capture and evocative as the title. I would have liked to see the rest of the lion''s body, but I guess it would have been in shade a bit too much?', '2006-09-12 06:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826773, 391426, 35602, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous cat.  Looks like a baby tiger.  I love the idea.  Strange as it seems, I think the color choice for the clothes behind the cat kind of take away from the brilliant color and markings.  <br/> <br/>I do have cats, and I can definitely appreciate this image.</td>', 'That is a gorgeous cat.  Looks like a baby tiger.  I love the idea.  Strange as it seems, I think the color choice for the clothes behind the cat kind of take away from the brilliant color and markings.   I do have cats, and I can definitely appreciate this image.', '2006-09-12 07:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826776, 389375, 35602, '<td valign="top">One of the best chocolates around.  Nice detail.  Was it the bittersweet?  That stuff is awesome.</td>', 'One of the best chocolates around.  Nice detail.  Was it the bittersweet?  That stuff is awesome.', '2006-09-12 07:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826780, 391202, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrasting color between the sky and the cliffs.  Looks nice and warm.  I think a little less foreground would have given the image a real boost.</td>', 'Very nice contrasting color between the sky and the cliffs.  Looks nice and warm.  I think a little less foreground would have given the image a real boost.', '2006-09-12 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826783, 388505, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful piece of our connections to our pets.  It really would have been so much of a stronger composition focusing more on the woman and cat, with a hint of fence behind them.  The additional details do not add anything to this lovely photo.</td>', 'This is a wonderful piece of our connections to our pets.  It really would have been so much of a stronger composition focusing more on the woman and cat, with a hint of fence behind them.  The additional details do not add anything to this lovely photo.', '2006-09-12 07:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826847, 391743, 38032, '<td valign="top">interesting composition here.</td>', 'interesting composition here.', '2006-09-12 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826849, 390906, 38032, '<td valign="top">This has potential ... the subject is perfect,  but the colors are a bit flat and there appears to be a great deal of noise in the image.  It''s tough to shoot crumpled up foil also so if it were me I''d just leave that out - same thing with the candle-holder - getting that stuff perfect involves advanced lighting technique.</td>', 'This has potential ... the subject is perfect,  but the colors are a bit flat and there appears to be a great deal of noise in the image.  It''s tough to shoot crumpled up foil also so if it were me I''d just leave that out - same thing with the candle-holder - getting that stuff perfect involves advanced lighting technique.', '2006-09-12 08:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826850, 391575, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome faces!</td>', 'Awesome faces!', '2006-09-12 08:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826851, 388063, 38032, '<td valign="top">Ahh now this is intriguing -- I''m guessing you have posted the address of this fine establishment in the description so we can all go there :)-  nice range of tones in this.</td>', 'Ahh now this is intriguing -- I''m guessing you have posted the address of this fine establishment in the description so we can all go there :)-  nice range of tones in this.', '2006-09-12 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2826859, 391186, 38032, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and set-up. It looks like the light umbrella completely covered the pupil on this.  I would have never thought how much that could distract from an otherwise cute and technically excellent photo.</td>', 'Cute idea and set-up. It looks like the light umbrella completely covered the pupil on this.  I would have never thought how much that could distract from an otherwise cute and technically excellent photo.', '2006-09-12 08:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826863, 391436, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like it.  My prediction is that you''ll get mix reviews on this one only because of the nature of people.  The colors and composition here are great - the subject''s head seems to be the main subject here and I think it could use just a hint more focus.  7</td>', 'I like it.  My prediction is that you''ll get mix reviews on this one only because of the nature of people.  The colors and composition here are great - the subject''s head seems to be the main subject here and I think it could use just a hint more focus.  7', '2006-09-12 08:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826867, 391301, 38032, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  The candy necklace is a nice touch.  It looks a bit blown out in the lighter areas  - a good way to combat this is to use a circular polarizing filter.</td>', 'Very cute.  The candy necklace is a nice touch.  It looks a bit blown out in the lighter areas  - a good way to combat this is to use a circular polarizing filter.', '2006-09-12 08:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826868, 390852, 38032, '<td valign="top">A subject like this needes a more unique perspective, lighting and composition IMO.</td>', 'A subject like this needes a more unique perspective, lighting and composition IMO.', '2006-09-12 08:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826872, 391442, 38032, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy -  We just used some of our tomatoes last night (TMI?) I''m curious whether taking out a bit of yellow might make it even yummier!  I also wonder if moving the subject up a tiny tiny bit in that crop might help the composition. 6</td>', 'Looks yummy -  We just used some of our tomatoes last night (TMI?) I''m curious whether taking out a bit of yellow might make it even yummier!  I also wonder if moving the subject up a tiny tiny bit in that crop might help the composition. 6', '2006-09-12 08:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826876, 390589, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great color and interesting composition.</td>', 'Great color and interesting composition.', '2006-09-12 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826881, 390343, 38032, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in geometry and tone.</td>', 'Interesting study in geometry and tone.', '2006-09-12 08:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826882, 391103, 38032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful city image.  He makes me want to take a nap myself :)</td>', 'Wonderful city image.  He makes me want to take a nap myself :)', '2006-09-12 08:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826888, 389216, 49018, '<td valign="top">Really like this one.</td>', 'Really like this one.', '2006-09-12 08:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826889, 391717, 49018, '<td valign="top">Would have like it more without the blueish cast. Nice idea though,</td>', 'Would have like it more without the blueish cast. Nice idea though,', '2006-09-12 08:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826898, 390689, 49018, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and certainly fits the challenge. The expression on the baby''s face is really cute and natural. Well framed. Warmer colours and less detail in the background (Shallower DOF) would have improved the feeling and enhance the focus on the main subject (but its a basic editing challenge.. )</td>', 'It''s nice and certainly fits the challenge. The expression on the baby''s face is really cute and natural. Well framed. Warmer colours and less detail in the background (Shallower DOF) would have improved the feeling and enhance the focus on the main subject (but its a basic editing challenge.. )', '2006-09-12 08:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826900, 391258, 49018, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge but the composition should have included the boy''s head a nd possibly the arm. A capture angle from below could have worked better.</td>', 'Fits the challenge but the composition should have included the boy''s head a nd possibly the arm. A capture angle from below could have worked better.', '2006-09-12 08:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826901, 390299, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like it. Would have loved to see a little bit more detail in the highligts of the flowers but a very very nice capture. I like the noise too.</td>', 'Nice. I like it. Would have loved to see a little bit more detail in the highligts of the flowers but a very very nice capture. I like the noise too.', '2006-09-12 08:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826903, 390193, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice one, maybe having more of the glove and less of the tree would have helped, but exposition for the subject and DOF are really good.</td>', 'Nice one, maybe having more of the glove and less of the tree would have helped, but exposition for the subject and DOF are really good.', '2006-09-12 08:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826905, 391261, 49018, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but a cleaner and sharper glass would have helped. Potentially a good phtograph.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but a cleaner and sharper glass would have helped. Potentially a good phtograph.', '2006-09-12 08:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826906, 391685, 49018, '<td valign="top">Could have been good, but it is definetely oversharpened and too noisy. I like the composition though.</td>', 'Could have been good, but it is definetely oversharpened and too noisy. I like the composition though.', '2006-09-12 08:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826910, 391690, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good job! The only thing is the lack of detail in the highlights, particularly on the fingers holding the butterfly. But a very nice capture indeed, and it fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Good job! The only thing is the lack of detail in the highlights, particularly on the fingers holding the butterfly. But a very nice capture indeed, and it fits the challenge very well.', '2006-09-12 08:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826912, 388976, 49109, '<td valign="top">coffe looks good, but DANGER sign is very distracting</td>', 'coffe looks good, but DANGER sign is very distracting', '2006-09-12 08:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826917, 390175, 49018, '<td valign="top">It does not fit the challenge perfectly in my opinion. Otherwise a very nice photo. Maybe a having the bottom of the shot in sharp focus too would have been better. there are very strong lines leading to the dog there, but they got a little bit lost because of the shallow depth of focus. Very nice one anyway!</td>', 'It does not fit the challenge perfectly in my opinion. Otherwise a very nice photo. Maybe a having the bottom of the shot in sharp focus too would have been better. there are very strong lines leading to the dog there, but they got a little bit lost because of the shallow depth of focus. Very nice one anyway!', '2006-09-12 08:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826923, 389710, 49018, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice. DOF is all right. The image fits the challenge. But it definetely needs more contrast (curve or levels in photoshop or any other program might help a lot).</td>', 'The composition is nice. DOF is all right. The image fits the challenge. But it definetely needs more contrast (curve or levels in photoshop or any other program might help a lot).', '2006-09-12 08:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826934, 391675, 44224, '<td valign="top">Just a tad too dark around the muzzle but what a cutey.</td>', 'Just a tad too dark around the muzzle but what a cutey.', '2006-09-12 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826941, 391689, 44224, '<td valign="top">I like this, i think there is a touch too much space above the bears head and would probably have been enhanced with more cropping. Lovely image though.</td>', 'I like this, i think there is a touch too much space above the bears head and would probably have been enhanced with more cropping. Lovely image though.', '2006-09-12 09:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2826944, 390887, 44224, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that the frogs head is slightly out of focus.</td>', 'It''s a shame that the frogs head is slightly out of focus.', '2006-09-12 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
