(2830334, 391426, 63152, '<td valign="top">To answer everyone. The cat in the photo is my Bengal cat Nikita. <br/> <br/>Bengal cats are a fairly new cat breed. They were created by hybridising together a wild spotted cat called the Asian Leopard Cat and normal domestic cats. Her pattern is only this dramatic on the belly (the wild cat has a white belly, most bengal cats don''t but their underside is much paler and clearer than their bodies.<br/> <br/>Her back and sides are a nutty brown colour with black spots, some of them multy toned. I love photographing her and I''m trying to get beyond the typical "cat snapshot" although I confess this photo could have been set up better.<br/> <br/>For those of you who are thinking about getting bengals. Do some research first but overall they are very energetic, fun, active and clever cats but they can be quite a handful so if you want a low maintenance cat Benals aren''t the right breed.<br/> <br/>Thank you everyone for your comments and votes. This was my first challenge entry and I was hoping I wouldn''t tank completely</td>', 'To answer everyone. The cat in the photo is my Bengal cat Nikita.  Bengal cats are a fairly new cat breed. They were created by hybridising together a wild spotted cat called the Asian Leopard Cat and normal domestic cats. Her pattern is only this dramatic on the belly (the wild cat has a white belly, most bengal cats don''t but their underside is much paler and clearer than their bodies. Her back and sides are a nutty brown colour with black spots, some of them multy toned. I love photographing her and I''m trying to get beyond the typical "cat snapshot" although I confess this photo could have been set up better. For those of you who are thinking about getting bengals. Do some research first but overall they are very energetic, fun, active and clever cats but they can be quite a handful so if you want a low maintenance cat Benals aren''t the right breed. Thank you everyone for your comments and votes. This was my first challenge entry and I was hoping I wouldn''t tank completely', '2006-09-13 03:44:56.000000', NULL, 0),
