(2831587, 389851, 50695, '<td valign="top">What I like most about this is that the noise and clutter of the vegetation makes it seem aggressive and adds a sense of scariness to the shot, but there is also a sense of supreme confidence in the girl. Scariness + confidence = Adventure!! Maybe that''s why the quasidesaturation works, because it gives it a pulp-novel-cover feel.</td>', 'What I like most about this is that the noise and clutter of the vegetation makes it seem aggressive and adds a sense of scariness to the shot, but there is also a sense of supreme confidence in the girl. Scariness + confidence = Adventure!! Maybe that''s why the quasidesaturation works, because it gives it a pulp-novel-cover feel.', '2006-09-13 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
