(2832946, 390439, 53572, '<td valign="top">i hope the kangaroo care works, and the baby is a happy and healthy one.  i do hope he/she wasn''t too early, bringing with it that much extra stress.<br/> <br/>photographically quite nice.  i think a tighter crop would have raised the score, as well as a wider tonal range - the greys are a little flat.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=395698" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/395698.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/395698.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/395698.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>i experimented a little with it.  i hope you don''t mind<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-13 20:09:44.</i></td>', 'i hope the kangaroo care works, and the baby is a happy and healthy one.  i do hope he/she wasn''t too early, bringing with it that much extra stress. photographically quite nice.  i think a tighter crop would have raised the score, as well as a wider tonal range - the greys are a little flat.   i experimented a little with it.  i hope you don''t mind', '2006-09-13 20:55:23.000000', '2006-09-13 21:09:44.000000', 0),
