(2833334, 391339, 93, '<td valign="top">You finally got her that ribbon, and I am so proud of you.<br/> <br/>I have tears in my eyes.<br/> <br/>You and Gracie deserve this more than I can put in words..  Wonderful job, great timing, and kudos for sticking with it through everything. You''re a true inspiration.</td>', 'You finally got her that ribbon, and I am so proud of you. I have tears in my eyes. You and Gracie deserve this more than I can put in words..  Wonderful job, great timing, and kudos for sticking with it through everything. You''re a true inspiration.', '2006-09-13 22:51:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2833373, 391658, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think with just the suckers, arranged like a lot of folks arrange colored pencils (ie the center in one of the thirds, then radiating out from there) would have worked very well.  Lighting is a bit on the harsh side, but by gosh, I still can''t quite figure how to do that well without simply shooting my cat in his chair when the sun has moved over the top of the house (which is how I get that light, by the way.)</td>', 'I think with just the suckers, arranged like a lot of folks arrange colored pencils (ie the center in one of the thirds, then radiating out from there) would have worked very well.  Lighting is a bit on the harsh side, but by gosh, I still can''t quite figure how to do that well without simply shooting my cat in his chair when the sun has moved over the top of the house (which is how I get that light, by the way.)', '2006-09-13 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
