(2833609, 390470, 36076, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by irakly:</b></div><hr/><i> is it really about pleasure? who is a recipient? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>yes. it really is about pleasure. to me there is nothing more than horses, but it''s deeper than that. the serenity of a big open field and yearlings moving quietly over pasture as the sun rises. being the only one on the land. just you and the horses. the smell of fresh air. the rising sun. the warmth of the air and the dampness of the rising dew.</td>', 'Originally posted by irakly: is it really about pleasure? who is a recipient?  yes. it really is about pleasure. to me there is nothing more than horses, but it''s deeper than that. the serenity of a big open field and yearlings moving quietly over pasture as the sun rises. being the only one on the land. just you and the horses. the smell of fresh air. the rising sun. the warmth of the air and the dampness of the rising dew.', '2006-09-14 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2833804, 390239, 63824, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tolovemoon:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on a awesome blue ribbon image! <br/>The experessions along with the colors from dark to light mathching the brown in the guitar just blends so well together!<br/>Coolest shot yet for music! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you very much!</td>', 'Originally posted by tolovemoon: Congrats on a awesome blue ribbon image! The experessions along with the colors from dark to light mathching the brown in the guitar just blends so well together!Coolest shot yet for music!  Thank you very much!', '2006-09-14 01:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
