(2844979, 389402, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/>Go figure, I just commented on your image earlier this AM and now it comes up at random as my Critique Club assignment.  Since I''ve already posted my critique, feel free to PM me for a free critique on any image in the future.<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club, Go figure, I just commented on your image earlier this AM and now it comes up at random as my Critique Club assignment.  Since I''ve already posted my critique, feel free to PM me for a free critique on any image in the future. Tim', '2006-09-18 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
