(2958561, 390730, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and cool silhouette.  Sky is a wee bit grainy but these less than ideal lighting conditions are tricky (I haven''t figured them out yet anyway).  I bet your fishing buddy loves this shot (assuming this is him).  Posting for challenges on this site is a blast but sometimes results in goofy meaningless shots in the long run.  It''s great when you can take one like this that is special beyond obtaining a decent score.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and cool silhouette.  Sky is a wee bit grainy but these less than ideal lighting conditions are tricky (I haven''t figured them out yet anyway).  I bet your fishing buddy loves this shot (assuming this is him).  Posting for challenges on this site is a blast but sometimes results in goofy meaningless shots in the long run.  It''s great when you can take one like this that is special beyond obtaining a decent score.  Well done.', '2006-10-24 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2967092, 388706, 60862, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nordicgirl:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting lights and colors...not really sure about cropping or maybe its confusing because there is not certain point of interest. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep - what she said.  The closeup is nice, but try to find something of special interest.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting and experimenting! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by nordicgirl: Interesting lights and colors...not really sure about cropping or maybe its confusing because there is not certain point of interest.   Yep - what she said.  The closeup is nice, but try to find something of special interest. Keep shooting and experimenting! :)', '2006-10-27 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3020619, 391711, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous vista and as a flyfisherman, I can appreciate the location. I agree with the previous commenters regarding the image being washed out.  If you continue to do shots like this, you''ll have to invest in a circular polarizer.  Sorry....but it means more money but it will cut down the glare and pop the colors. You may not have noticed but the horizon is slightly slanted.  Have a look at the waterline on the far shore.  It may appear that way because it is or maybe an illusion of the light from the left side to the right side of the image. I have been nailed on this before and you should be very aware of the impact it has on the viewer.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous vista and as a flyfisherman, I can appreciate the location. I agree with the previous commenters regarding the image being washed out.  If you continue to do shots like this, you''ll have to invest in a circular polarizer.  Sorry....but it means more money but it will cut down the glare and pop the colors. You may not have noticed but the horizon is slightly slanted.  Have a look at the waterline on the far shore.  It may appear that way because it is or maybe an illusion of the light from the left side to the right side of the image. I have been nailed on this before and you should be very aware of the impact it has on the viewer.  Hope that helps.', '2006-11-10 16:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3024701, 391689, 64460, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'I love this picture. Thanks for sharing!', '2006-11-12 22:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3045021, 391809, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s a very large hot air balloon compared to the ordinary run-off-the -maill garden variety hot air balloon. I guess that''s why it can carry so many people.</td>', 'That''s a very large hot air balloon compared to the ordinary run-off-the -maill garden variety hot air balloon. I guess that''s why it can carry so many people.', '2006-11-19 23:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
